      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We were so happy to be recommended The Sun Works by a neighbor after consults with other solar companies left us suspicious and cynical. The team at Sunworks were highly knowledgeable, experienced, respectful and personal.  By the time we contacted them we had become aware of how many cowboys are in this industry and the great disconnect between Sales & their Installers.  The Sun Works are such an integrated team.  We are so happy with the results and the follow up we have received since.  We have not opted for a battery as yet.  But we will most certainly be contacting The Sun Works when we are ready to install one.",
