      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I recently had the guys at The SunWorks Solar Centre install a new 6kw system on my residential roof on the Sunshine Coast. The sales consultant Mike was the only sales rep that actually knew what he was talking about when it came to export limiting power and overall system knowledge.I got five quotes in total and while The SunWorks weren't the cheapest, they were definitely the most knowledgeable.I went with a Fronius Primo 6.0 inverter & Fronius smart meter with 23 x REC TwinPeak 2 Mono 315watt panels.I had an existing 3kw system and the installers were able to limit the export total of the new and old systems combined to 5kw while still using the remaining 4kw locally.A very neat, clean and professional install, they turned up on time and completed the job to my expectations.I would highly recommend this company.",
